Package: stream-deck
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: jlumijarvi <jlumijarvi@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pil, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, libnotify-bin, pkexec
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Homepage: https://github.com/jlumijarvi/stream-deck
Description: Elgato Stream Deck board with Claude Code session keys
 Drives a 15-key Elgato Stream Deck (Original V2 or MK.2) on Linux without
 the Elgato software: configurable buttons, a clock, audio keys, a Slack
 unread badge, one key per running Claude Code session, a screen saver,
 a settings window and a top-bar icon.
